"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There are no complete award itineraries among the selected search results, so I can’t recommend a bookable award itinerary from these options. If you’re looking on January 1, check the United lead first: it reports 9 seats for one traveler, versus 2 on the Aeroplan lead, and a lower USD award-tax quote. The tradeoff is that neither result includes a schedule, and the quotes’ scope is unknown. Confirm current availability and details with the program before booking.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A2@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United award lead — January 1\",\"v\":\"The result reports economy on CA, UA, and ZH, 60,500 United miles, 9 seats, and USD 28.20 in award taxes. This is a date-only lead, not a complete itinerary: no flight times or connections are provided. The quote scope is unknown, so it cannot be treated as a per-person or party total.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A1@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan award lead — January 1\",\"v\":\"This date-only economy lead reports BR, 65,000 Aeroplan points, 2 seats, and CAD 116.50 in award taxes. It offers a different reported carrier and program from the United lead, but points across those programs are not directly comparable. No schedule or connections are shown, and the quote scope is unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A37@2027-01-12/SFO>BKK/P\",\"n\":\"Alaska award lead — January 12\",\"v\":\"If January 12 and premium economy suit your plans, this lead reports JX, 140,000 Alaska miles, 9 seats, and USD 50.90 in award taxes. It is also date-only, with no schedule or connections shown. Its points are not comparable with the United lead’s; the same-currency tax quotes are USD 28.20 and USD 50.90, but both have unknown scope and are not confirmed trip totals.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For cash context, a selected January 1 option is shown below. Its USD 640.00 fare has unknown scope, and it is a separate cash baseline—not an award alternative or a like-for-like total-cost comparison. Search coverage was partial, so these selected results do not represent all eligible inventory.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline — Cathay Pacific via HKG\",\"v\":\"The cash itinerary departs SFO at 10:55 p.m. local time on January 1 and arrives in BKK at 10:35 a.m. local time on January 4, with one stop in HKG. The reported duration is 44 hours 40 minutes, and the source quote is USD 640.00 with unknown scope. Verify the current fare and itinerary details before booking.\"}]}"
